{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1434,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43fa3f604957da7f3e44a2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈呼……——哈！\r\n才、才不困呢！\r\n老子通宵也轻轻松松！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e821e0c1c1b9c23114d837c96f112b6cd909ef44d09528a7d9308ca74181a58a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:834bed0cff778f01c24a2fbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直不可理喻……宿舍厕所灯快灭了\r\n这太给人添麻烦了吧！？没别的意思！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00c3038761e0677bd4df51a3a47be0225bff22b83225721bb5a8fd1022d42907",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e48de24ba7145c019dfd4d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的草地青青的很酷啊……\r\n沙地也搞个花坛什么的……？\r\n呀，踩到花会很不爽吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b38541f54a6d9f7e375d1036320d89dd2c865788ceb11dc5181b7de277b48e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50401164a17d20612bf35751",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "车站前的梨子芭菲确实好吃……\r\n但那芙莉欧索一脸得意的表情……！\r\n老子才不会向船桥屈服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a35d81762081abd449d7932babd334880a934f180dc0105481eb475185b88ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed64d38aace86a2180df361b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋冬的新款外套哪里都没货啊……\r\n可恶，只能找训练员做交易了吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fad76c0011530a83c934ae2ee8db4673f8e6fd77f7bd912483dd35b0cd1508a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea9e73a099bfa1374627bf1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷什么的，别怂啊！\r\n老子刚才还在外面吃了冰激凌呢，\r\n呵……哈、哈嚏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d53b23287562e5256af8c0b85f7c02f714bfe5073bf709e0a3f5c0fab73502e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35fedc805402119c22b140f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……情人节……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b04425715dba7055fb13165722fa9f8f00f490d16b41dbc01ad4df60822776e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15122fa0f6e8c42200305e61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏那家伙，把我当乖孩子对待\r\n搬东西只是因为看她太慢了受不了而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13857038d302b356d5cdc5d041894a18ec993993613459be08d5ba9a2b563725",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeea213bf906bc0d6d3abea0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小林立奇，又在说什么风水之类的\r\n把房间重新装修了……。\r\n嘛，挺新鲜的，心情倒是不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63fa0067e47aacb85ba580e725eb11f6bcaf6d8abe21ad91160b564b72dcb850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4abb44cf5fc05dfb4ff065ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "北港火山送了一一大堆蓝靛果过来\r\n真是的，都说不需要谢礼了。\r\n……嘛，会吃的就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f3d1970a4eb0571d815173d7af77bd3fd903967702e025bf50c8409ab72f839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:619de4a06167c9dd245f1aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我弟弟考试考了100分哦！\r\n哼哼，怎么样，很强吧。毕竟是我弟弟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c228cae40fad506f233eb3b42c179726e48181177e45e4e32fb53347c847f4f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:853291c040128c1a1a79c63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼——哈——呼——！！啊！？\r\n只是吃了点激辣拉面而已……\r\n怎么了，挺好吃的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ec0bdd13d58a7096b132a979495438b0b46e7942b72750c04616fdcb04cecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e38a5f5639bb74c04eb25c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个，感觉是可爱系的……\r\n看起来一点都不强。嘛，下摆的感觉\r\n……倒还是挺酷的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a1e88c864142e22ed8a05ce2f5c6faff027bab3c7a2268de31e97f6fe3bda1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3512630a0b5f681031c214ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昂？编舞和歌都轻轻松松。完美！\r\n太水的演出会被人瞧不起的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "357551c01ab7a51005eb1994eec7aeee15d38fa5e2da88524c75b665e949ed1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4a43c9df6661cd70adb022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼！怎么样，\r\n闪瞎眼了吧，吓到了吧！\r\n这可是我浑身解数的胜负服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88b66f36671354f57ec8a272326a28e51d94462fd69a211a7ac23fb76be413d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2704a13ca31aaf794f14dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“小跳跳”弄脏了。得赶紧洗……\r\n——哈！不是！是配饰！\r\n要是脏了就很逊吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0c4a6426dd9ce6b14d8960e515a633d318f7fda741fa5d5aa12abc0ba30018",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f80d4a0e0266c3d584f43014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早饭什么的我有在吃！不用你说！！\r\n三文鱼、豆腐、味增汁、羊栖菜——你那什么表情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05ae1d438aa484267cd1203e63d5fb9c2b5bf4508d24041d60331c523a88def7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c04f80839a6c6f22a39af63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的。太阳神那家伙真让人费心。\r\n话说她求救的那个课题，不是昨天截止吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f46f35fdc66de6ef1b0210bc66c3090d68938d85787a9fee3d3b3482f973963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7633417ec7d9f7905a713c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼！轻轻松松甩掉你们！\r\n做好觉悟吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b30e2f95fd21a48d36c117766205de6619ae3b35b9da01b9ec7d1402bcab916c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b717bde80c15ad18f9cdbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是想要金色的“Bling Bling”\r\n挂件啊……晚上也显眼，看起来又强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae3591ff9b591e767f397d280811714ae15a66935fa0bfa98fe2e1454d01cc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bad25247a412468cd2124c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能被新入生瞧不起啊！\r\n被打招呼的时候，我要压低声音\r\n回礼吓吓他们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fae684288d73952f3c2ea04270222c3078a1946b36c667ba84ea7c95023bdfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335b0b143adbe1e9d1f910c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新款刨冰？反正又是奶油加一堆\r\n甜得发腻的东西吧！……嘛，\r\n看在味道的份上？尝尝也不是不行？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0a98fed1702d189f2b0e494005b0dfea65cc28ee929c5d02eb2262741d77293",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:106375375966fc2b0b985a84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天教本什么的也会打折啊……\r\n我要一直守到打骨折的\r\n底价再买爆它们……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f6917343acd02401961ea81770ca98a42667cc2068e9b405cdc34e71c3f43f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397aee9f04e2d73e51bcae10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积雪什么的简直最糟糕了。又滑又硬\r\n摔了可疼了！……才不会摔倒呢！？说我呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8986e9987ab0fca08f70d0d3b2b36133374ddb967ba09954db1d2129a1ac050e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88afc1ea584f0dfc3f7bfd87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，开始了。\r\n要是拿半吊子的任务\r\n糊弄我，老子可不饶你！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1beaea6df9c2d4c05965a77c1af0762a3d86f7c5d58db8376b225004ac339d0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46cf894d9de7ff1b7364d1a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备活动早就做完了！\r\n老子才不是那种会在基础的基础\r\n就掉链子的菜鸡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "802b85d32306ec246134c70039f706f943369b42b83e8d321e92f1789d2824cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e6d8fd2556ebe802a371b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶紧开始训练！\r\n要让周围的家伙们看清楚，\r\n最强的是老子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f917580c74896798cf2f671f294b7a34d14894dedd76ca888ba59d7e387e99df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f9740c42084822157f57bd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "管你什么尽管放马过来！\r\n我会完成两倍的训练量给你看的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf342182c8d18bbb72530c63caaad6a11e82bbfe6cb1bb957a97ad4872ec303c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1d509b7428eb44b9b35e1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要做那个训练，老子就能变强了吧\r\n……你要是敢骗我，老子饶不了你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c32e27ca09dc298a9fa21115ca55c3d03619191e595fdd0055d3c62913af87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9cc2a68a4c99b0eb3d8d8b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉力量确实变强了……\r\n这是你的工作吧，给我拿出点自信来啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31fdb4180c6b3135232951ead800bf4236c408ec1e79cefb51b083b12c571fda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a887baaca10db419b8748b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……喂，快出下一个指示。\r\n昂，我是因为认可了你的菜单才听你话的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "450b80b64a4323c7ccc37a206c82e22194c82293b67edbf8b86f4897d8fe23cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a43d6654d9d35cbdac896db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私用的泳衣也带了！黑底加超酷\r\n花纹的那种！毕竟战斗力不能掉啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94737e6d62d3e71dea52b894803b338d19467d042c95ebacdd7e6dc2ed83c33f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:975ae108d241f474740d7987",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们简直最强！就这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3374a9abac0c1045039ef6aff8d4f5c29e81800a7348bca63e8710e4a4e89c41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc0f58be953c6cc4a3b6ab05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把全员都打脸了！全打成小鸡仔了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "620b21e9c15b65a8e215f4ae237db25424a8ce5481dd67a43e6498b7f360f77c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:469b6ab02aa881506c59ea8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会变得更强的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be5eface2aa31a9c591c8e9e94050c19303a0d684c3c410d19bb5290a6458d20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3449c7cc0cf7f333725d0ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别瞧不起人！老子没有极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6957fbfc27afbc18be2b74114f546c3c3c9c787351a94d80e730156b06af003a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a61569507ea5161e5469158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是希望之城啊，噢啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3783ec3ad83f7339fd05f9cf1331cffa78bd399b40c540a2be50d7e1f9e2e059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4862136d03233029826a534",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别瞧不起人！\r\n要让你们明白老子才是最强的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc1df163470c0eb551744f74bb0ab58584aea18d30d080d352b26763ae3a3465",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f946ef817f889cf1c2af586b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，帮帮你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4c3be8e8b6feba478ce40d454fc0ebf21820bdabfae875e2583d8805df96a7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21eab1b71d440a1ec74f8814",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种程度轻轻松松吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea7fb23cbc8596b0d6eea2108db082e84ead40f86556fd5369bb469ef8ecdf90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40a86a0cd801480d074fa40c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ときめきを胸に！",
      "source_fingerprint": "372c9338da6689aa9e9d895d5c04453264e6b167b2a8b9a20bf9dfcf3f1710c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd11f78654ef46f203fe297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたしが『わたし』を愛せる\r\nように。最高のコーディネートを\r\nこれからも探し続けます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b7ae124e5822ec4fc4c734c13dc1fc90f61a16b4691903a8f444ca89e04b87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2605c4cdf172ec9dd57a1e72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b12b3041c50bf2736bd27654",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7cc6951a920e8084573735e4a0908d6d6b34e24b6a55a0aeb4ac698d3b94d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929a2c33ed5587fc5e40098a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつか未知の輝きをまとったとき、\r\nその煌めきを広げてくれるのは…\r\nきっと、あなたなんだと思います。",
      "source_fingerprint": "465f63946ebae114b4e035d224351a7d6683b44cda917fe444799831895fd9b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44550f578c269f6fdbed2bf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日より明日、明日より明後日…\r\n一緒にいればいるほど、きっと\r\nわたしたちの輝きは増すんです♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f09cf832a0f4990904accd8be90a135264a1e8cc698699a1d22b9ff2a6f1e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66210bdfa20fc6a253a82898",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着物を今風にアレンジして楽しんで\r\nみませんか？小物を工夫する\r\nだけでも、全然違って見えますよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8cb6d2e4420a78fca9b625f2616da49765c021d5cd26948ddbcb38093a66b77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38b2c27ebea465236c1f7863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パティシエの技は芸術的ですね。\r\nチョコや飴細工で、ドレスだって\r\n宝石だって象れてしまうんですから",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e102a524381ddda15827b55481bb09f89e8a54c7405fecd2276f89f62beb75d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ad8ae240337c368d9af0a14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想いを込めたらうっかりハート型\r\nばかりに…えへへ。アイシング\r\nクッキー、受け取ってくださいね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "db167542813c2a10355703e48e7a1ec435039b4afec5381ea48ba2ebe19f6dfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2651aac2288618927de4eec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "織姫と彦星も、会うときには\r\nどんな着物にしようかなって\r\n悩んだりするんでしょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cda6544daf20ac1bf8057e3c28849e7eec5b31f91a805d3497910a7e620702e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed3ad71532cd66ccf581110b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仮装は特に個性が光りますね！\r\nミイラも吸血鬼も獣人も、特徴を\r\n活かしたスタイルでキメないと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e08a4f5bfe9c6c1d70cdee10db1c70340d560cf7831321f7e80230eadd1d2cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1173d9ed9d04b3ae653d1a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お友だちに頼まれてクリスマス\r\nコーデをしたんですが…ふふふ。\r\n服も瞳もキラキラになりました♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe9a41fddfdd76cd935e100e0a22a394407b127056ed2c1b912620a315f80e3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63309615b65c03b9134c49d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日は大人カワイイで決めよう\r\nかと…トレーナーさんと過ごす\r\n大切なクリスマスですから♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "34dc8c6f6fc9666544d87e421b44054946e78ae5c8f008decbf572eca783e75c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2374c0d151fcb4b28bef9178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりました♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a4f9e40671dbf06b88f17d7e7dd9aff0b04a727a4775d8855a5dc9a3d244ace",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d8d836d3c770eda9aa5cbe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来年はどんなファッションが\r\n流行るんでしょう？\r\nふふふっ、当てっこしましょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "395b2bacb5ab0027ebeee2e65ad671bed3c6166b250f0a9ddc5eb935ac96a53d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d178882ed4a3af184c4ddec3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お誕生日おめでとうございます！\r\n今日はいつもと違うコーデにして\r\n新しい自分を見つけてみませんか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7793551d8721cc54c194584862745a26eb027bb592ecc14b426ac5435c617a4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab941d42d11a9e10b75e4b76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お誕生会の飾りつけもごちそうも、\r\nいっしょに考えて用意したいです。\r\n他にない特別な1日になるように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "091f628291dda4bdf12f71f880dd693645f171276f05cdac4df9276b7da58c01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f44fb1f35d1ff168f39c98f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日はトレーナーさんがわたしの\r\n服を選んでくれませんか？\r\n心を込めたバースデー・コーデを♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42b0be7576de90a6cc1c66e895bc5f6ed5d2f4e21fdce0c1ced32ae037045e5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad4f784d09ffbd0b2a6b6e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気持ちがこもったプレゼントは\r\nどんなものよりも価値があります。\r\nだから今年も…最高の誕生日です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c84b6cefc91c3cc018f3e6b0282a8b7ba45bbf1e13e4611141796b8a1125fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:154554343246a3a65fed6413",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お知らせがきています。\r\n早めのチェックが大事だって\r\nお姉ちゃんが言ってました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c90c21e43eed8c6f8cbd44c464bb7d9ce4c802f6d9d731afdf844affee88440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f83b98b4476619a72116af84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントがあるみたいです。\r\nふふっ、どんな煌めきを\r\n持っているのか楽しみですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dcfa9a1bb45937a41c08f2db318b4bf2baceedc551229e2f060fe4c4cde3979",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b2d3bc4268b80d0c3111356",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッションクリア！\r\n素晴らしいです。\r\nまた輝きが増しましたね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57aa92593ce6874df42997bdf344eaba3014bfe591e0e417eb222914b2603b26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b332bdd9448a0be98bd7d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントがあるようです。\r\nどんなコーデで参加するか、\r\n考えておかなくちゃ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b14b2bf0ae366f2b90110540700f0b3d882a7740b8c8a19f9a8040e1194aff38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fb3e387e79fae9142f798f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが始まっていますよ。\r\n賑やかで楽しそうです。\r\n見に行ってみませんか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ad0e4d51a3bf3ae9dcc460741756dd62a0b1e04a2f3d36b4f32c9096c0f7d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34091f010c203038e1321e9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次こそは、ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b879712ea6f482f273a67a8ae206147d9833adb87b43de6c5d18d1e2ede65e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c9e93035b8867ca010f7894",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鑑レベルが上がりましたね。\r\nさすがです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10a842d9a3dbfb8d398d4b0a1dc0bf6760cc025eb363155683366d8e6e1b24da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e05f12bb76eb40830125749b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互角でしたね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d82aeb1ce472cd8baa30e032809c5f4c0e4e9675133dfad033e83929caa0d27d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32de44991ed5c602a344105",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利です♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa83ceab8b0f7ddcb00f05d705cc634d08aaa30ed5330c1bff5433ce58145d49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cddbd013fc8d6cb960e1a606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次こそは、ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b879712ea6f482f273a67a8ae206147d9833adb87b43de6c5d18d1e2ede65e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9967dc4130acfa528db6515f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互角でしたね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d82aeb1ce472cd8baa30e032809c5f4c0e4e9675133dfad033e83929caa0d27d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2fff60555c59fcf4d089228",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "記録更新です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53180df418ef02a8975384c5dffb2649485d82c9943837df096619915bf6ed0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e095979f3f320529c609e33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたしたちなりの輝きで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c70a2103044aad89429a1a4517f5f8c0d17f0cba8255e6d7383b5d0ebea219",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c700337399466f15dd8e2c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf994bc9e38af2335f90b338",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "煌めきを纏うために、\r\n素材を磨きましょう♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0d629b99721cc2a19b3cd2b638f81624fef715b26f6d54ddb60f72bc55ae2fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28d64ce3edf17a191472a6bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多くの輝き、それぞれの光。\r\n本当にまぶしいですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8731701a13c303b4335237fa3ebde4f02ee7d2c91510f790afa5dca0cda73484",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0595241e7865c3248c3c84b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースですか？しっかり\r\n準備をしなくちゃですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9056f097158d0501ea2a7739ce27462eca446cf0bbda365dc97e11b7071c65ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e4832fb23929ab1d0667a28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2def92b8c11a0bf35d74a872",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力が、あふれて…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66126cc828271a2df4efc4ccd951e5e3935eae863659db7b15d0f93a71ff7d6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2261a1ec98331d3e64fa479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ナイスコーデ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1e35869679c181fe06633d904fc2f5774c462d02b6a77363b15056f3d29ecef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "1203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ae810b7d915b5b985fc28e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おしゃれ番長と。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dea910da0939ebf8ccab668a063ef14fcf328e8ff20ba758692475f48b54848",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
